FEXCore: log the CPU probes a 32-bit program makes ([cpu-probe] lines)

Diagnostic for Steam's CEG step (Black Ops 1). Logs, on the error channel:
- the guest cycle counter rate (host counter and SmallTSCScale shift), once per process;
- each distinct cpuid function/leaf once, with the values the guest gets;
- the first 48 compiled sites of cpuid, rdtsc, rdtscp, sgdt, sidt, smsw, int,
  and unimplemented, privileged or invalid opcodes, with the guest address.

Applies to willfaust/FEX f59cab9 (the pinned FEX). The rebuilt WOW64 module is
app/Madeira/aarch64-windows/xtajit.dll (build/fex-wow64/build.sh). Not for FEX-Emu.

